# Prose files exempted from scripts/check-code-citations.mjs, one path per
# line, checked as a prefix. The format is file-level: a listed file has
# every citation in it skipped, including the ones into this repository.
#
# Nothing is listed. The two entries that were here, docs/REVIEW_2026-05-03.md
# and docs/ARCHITECTURE-REVIEW-2026-09-14.md, hid nine dead citations into
# this repository's own code while exempting the cross-repo ones they were
# added for. Both files now name cross-repo paths without a file extension,
# so the checker leaves those alone and checks everything else.
#
# Before adding a file here, check whether the citation can be written so it
# does not parse as a path in this repository. A file-level exemption stops
# the check finding the defects it exists to find.
